--- (3) THE CONTRACT (pre-registered decision rule) ---
  STEP   iff w90 + 3 sw90 < 0.5            -> FIRST-ORDER STEP CONFIRMED (the kink)
  SMOOTH iff 0.5 < w90 < 2.0 and w90 - 3 sw90 > 0.5 -> SMOOTH KERNEL
  WIDE   iff w90 - 3 sw90 > 2.0      -> NEITHER reading (both falsified)
  else INCONCLUSIVE; sw90 = bootstrap 68% spread of the fitted w90
  pipeline: (1) beta extraction (G164 convention) (2) logistic step-fit,
            r_c held at the detected kink 6.33 (free in [6.1, 6.74] as 
            the robustness variant), w free (3) bootstrap width error 
            (4) decide()

